# meg

--- MechaDude_Heal | gadget | TID_ACCESSORY_MECHA_DUDE_HEAL_DESC
raw  Heal the Mecha by <VALUE1> health per second for <VALUE2> seconds. Can only be used in mecha form.
now  Heal the Mecha by <VALUE1> health per second for <VALUE2> seconds. Can only be used in mecha form.
  VALUE1  -  -> 518
  VALUE2  -  -> 5

--- MechaDude_Heal | gadget | TID_MECHADUDE_BUDDY_GADGET_1_DESC
raw  Can only be used in Mecha form. The Mecha and nearby teammates heal for <!buddy.accessory.value1>% each sec for <!buddy.accessory.activetime.ticksasseconds> sec.
now  Can only be used in Mecha form. The Mecha and nearby teammates heal for 11% each sec for <!buddy.accessory.activetime.ticksasseconds> sec.
  buddy.accessory.value1  11  -> 11
  buddy.accessory.activetime.ticksasseconds  -  -> 6

--- MechaDude_Heal | gadget | TID_MECHADUDE_BUDDY_GADGET_1_DIFF
raw  Jolting Volts heals for +<!buddy.accessory.additionalactivetime.ticksasseconds> sec.
now  Jolting Volts heals for +<!buddy.accessory.additionalactivetime.ticksasseconds> sec.
  buddy.accessory.additionalactivetime.ticksasseconds  -  -> 6

--- MechaDude_ReloadTower | gadget | TID_ACCESSORY_MECHA_DUDE_TOWER_RELOAD_DESC
raw  Meg ejects from the Mecha, launching it forward, dealing <!card.accessory.skill.damage.scaleStatToLevel> damage on the way. Charges Super after during the next <!card.character.component[0].values[1].ticksasseconds>  seconds.
now  Meg ejects from the Mecha, launching it forward, dealing 1600 damage on the way. Charges Super after during the next 6  seconds.
  card.accessory.skill.damage.scaleStatToLevel  1600  -> 1600
  card.character.component[0].values[1].ticksasseconds  6  -> 6

--- MechaDude_ReloadTower | gadget | TID_MECHADUDE_BUDDY_GADGET_2_DESC
raw  Meg ejects, launching her Mecha forward, dealing <!buddy.accessory.skill.damage.scaleStatToLevel> damage and leaving a trail of fire dealing <!areaeffect[MechaDudeGadgetBuddyFire].damage>% of the damage for <!areaeffect[MechaDudeGadgetBuddyFire].timems.msasseconds> seconds.\nAfter ejecting, Meg fully charges her super over <!card.character.component[0].values[1].ticksasseconds> sec.
now  Meg ejects, launching her Mecha forward, dealing 1600 damage and leaving a trail of fire dealing 30% of the damage for 3 seconds.\nAfter ejecting, Meg fully charges her super over 6 sec.
  buddy.accessory.skill.damage.scaleStatToLevel  1600  -> 1600
  areaeffect[MechaDudeGadgetBuddyFire].damage  30  -> 30
  areaeffect[MechaDudeGadgetBuddyFire].timems.msasseconds  3  -> 3
  card.character.component[0].values[1].ticksasseconds  6  -> 6

--- MechaDude_ReloadTower | gadget | TID_MECHADUDE_BUDDY_GADGET_2_DIFF
raw  The Mecha leaves a trail of fire dealing <!areaeffect[MechaDudeGadgetBuddyFire].damage>% of the launched Mecha damage for <!areaeffect[MechaDudeGadgetBuddyFire].timems.msasseconds> sec.
now  The Mecha leaves a trail of fire dealing 30% of the launched Mecha damage for 3 sec.
  areaeffect[MechaDudeGadgetBuddyFire].damage  30  -> 30
  areaeffect[MechaDudeGadgetBuddyFire].timems.msasseconds  3  -> 3

--- MechaDude_overcharge | hypercharge | TID_MECHA_DUDE_OVERCHARGE_DESC
raw  Feel the Steel has increased range, and enemies hit when Meg deploys the Mecha are slowed for <!card.character.component[0].areaeffect[2].statuseffectenemy.duration.ticksasseconds> sec.
now  Feel the Steel has increased range, and enemies hit when Meg deploys the Mecha are slowed for 1 sec.
  card.character.component[0].areaeffect[2].statuseffectenemy.duration.ticksasseconds  1  -> 1

--- MechaDude_overcharge | hypercharge | TID_MECHADUDE_BUDDY_OVERCHARGE_DESC
raw  Feel the Steel has increased range. Entering the Mecha slows nearby enemies for <!card.character.component[0].areaeffect[2].statuseffectenemy.duration.ticksasseconds> sec. The Mecha's Main Attack explodes, dealing <!card.character.pet.weaponskill.overchargedversion.overchargedprojectile.onenemyhitaction.areaeffect.damage.scaleStatToLevel> area damage. Outside her Mecha, Meg's Main attack homes in on enemies and fires an extra projectile.
now  Feel the Steel has increased range. Entering the Mecha slows nearby enemies for 1 sec. The Mecha's Main Attack explodes, dealing <!card.character.pet.weaponskill.overchargedversion.overchargedprojectile.onenemyhitaction.areaeffect.damage.scaleStatToLevel> area damage. Outside her Mecha, Meg's Main attack homes in on enemies and fires an extra projectile.
  card.character.component[0].areaeffect[2].statuseffectenemy.duration.ticksasseconds  1  -> 1
  card.character.pet.weaponskill.overchargedversion.overchargedprojectile.onenemyhitaction.areaeffect.damage.scaleStatToLevel  -  -> 400

--- MechaDude_overcharge | hypercharge | TID_MECHADUDE_BUDDY_OVERCHARGE_DIFF
raw  The Mecha's Main Attack explodes, dealing <!card.character.pet.weaponskill.overchargedversion.overchargedprojectile.onenemyhitaction.areaeffect.damage.scaleStatToLevel> area damage. Outside her Mecha, Meg's Main Attack homes to enemies and fires an extra projectile.
now  The Mecha's Main Attack explodes, dealing <!card.character.pet.weaponskill.overchargedversion.overchargedprojectile.onenemyhitaction.areaeffect.damage.scaleStatToLevel> area damage. Outside her Mecha, Meg's Main Attack homes to enemies and fires an extra projectile.
  card.character.pet.weaponskill.overchargedversion.overchargedprojectile.onenemyhitaction.areaeffect.damage.scaleStatToLevel  -  -> 400

