now  When exiting the Mecha, Meg gains 30% shield and +20% movement speed for 5 sec.
  card.value1  30  -> 30
  buddy.trait.value  20  -> 20
  card.value2.ticksasseconds  5  -> 5

--- MechaDude_unique | star power | TID_MECHADUDE_BUDDY_STARPOWER_1_DIFF
raw  Meg gains +<!buddy.trait.value>% movement speed while the shield is active.
now  Meg gains +20% movement speed while the shield is active.
  buddy.trait.value  20  -> 20

